Register LBP6300/LBP6300dn printer models in captdriver.

The printer responds to the CAPT identify command with an IEEE 1284 MODEL
string. Without a matching registration, rastertocapt exits with
"ERROR: CAPT: unknown printer". Add entries using the same ops as the
LBP3010 which has the most generic page setup sequence.

diff --git a/src/prn_lbp2900.c b/src/prn_lbp2900.c
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/src/prn_lbp2900.c
+++ b/src/prn_lbp2900.c
@@ -551,3 +551,5 @@ register_printer("LBP3100/LBP3108/LBP3150", lbp3010_ops.ops, EXPERIMENTAL);
 register_printer("LBP6000/LBP6018", lbp6000_ops.ops, EXPERIMENTAL);
+register_printer("LBP6300", lbp3010_ops.ops, EXPERIMENTAL);
+register_printer("LBP6300dn", lbp3010_ops.ops, EXPERIMENTAL);
